        "en": "**The app cannot check this part.** For the writing, please use pen and paper. For the speaking, say it out loud and, if you can, practise with a native speaker or a teacher who can correct you.\n\n**Write (100–120 words).** Write a message to a shop to return a product that does not work, explaining what you want.\n\n**Speak (about 2 minutes).** Return a product aloud in a shop: explain the problem and ask for an exchange or a refund."
